- page_title "Outbox"

header.mb-4
  h1.text-2xl.font-bold Outbox
  p.mt-1.text-sm.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400
    | Outbound deliveries the server still owes a remote mail server, one row per recipient. Deleting a row cancels it outright: no more retries, and no bounce back to the sender.

section.mb-8
  h2.mb-2.text-lg.font-semibold Waiting to send
  - if @queued.any?
    .overflow-x-auto.rounded-lg.border.border-slate-200.dark:border-slate-800.bg-white.dark:bg-slate-900
      table.w-full.text-left.text-sm
        thead.border-b.border-slate-200.dark:border-slate-800.text-xs.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400
          tr
            th.px-4.py-2 Queued
            th.px-4.py-2 From
            th.px-4.py-2 To
            th.px-4.py-2 Subject
            th.px-4.py-2 Attempts
            th.px-4.py-2 Next attempt
            th.px-4.py-2 Last error
            th.px-4.py-2
        tbody
          - @queued.each do |message|
            tr.border-b.border-slate-100.dark:border-slate-800.last:border-0
              td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400 title=message.created_at.iso8601
                = "#{time_ago_in_words(message.created_at)} ago"
              td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap= message.mail_from
              td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap= message.recipient
              td.px-4.py-2.max-w-64.truncate title=outbox_subject(message)
                = outbox_subject(message) || content_tag(:span, "(no subject)", class: "text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500")
              td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap= outbox_attempts_label(message)
              td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400
                - if message.delivering?
                  span class="rounded bg-accent/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-accent"
                    | sending now
                - elsif message.next_attempt_at.future?
                  = "in #{distance_of_time_in_words(Time.current, message.next_attempt_at)}"
                - else
                  | any moment
              td.px-4.py-2.max-w-72.truncate.text-xs.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400 title=message.last_error
                = message.last_error
              td.px-4.py-2.text-right
                = button_to "Delete", outbox_message_path(message), method: :delete,
                    disabled: message.delivering?,
                    class: "inline-block cursor-pointer rounded-md border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40",
                    form: { data: { turbo_confirm: "Delete the message to #{message.recipient}? It will not be sent, retried, or bounced." }, class: "inline-block" }
  - else
    p.text-sm.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400 Nothing waiting - the queue is empty.

section
  h2.mb-2.text-lg.font-semibold Failed
  p.mb-2.text-sm.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400
    | Deliveries that hit a permanent error or ran out of retries. The sender already received a bounce; these rows are kept for diagnosis and can be deleted freely.
  - if @failed.any?
    .overflow-x-auto.rounded-lg.border.border-slate-200.dark:border-slate-800.bg-white.dark:bg-slate-900
      table.w-full.text-left.text-sm
        thead.border-b.border-slate-200.dark:border-slate-800.text-xs.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400
          tr
            th.px-4.py-2 Failed
            th.px-4.py-2 From
            th.px-4.py-2 To
            th.px-4.py-2 Subject
            th.px-4.py-2 Attempts
            th.px-4.py-2 Last error
            th.px-4.py-2
        tbody
          - @failed.each do |message|
            tr.border-b.border-slate-100.dark:border-slate-800.last:border-0
              td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400 title=message.updated_at.iso8601
                = "#{time_ago_in_words(message.updated_at)} ago"
              td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap= message.mail_from
              td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap= message.recipient
              td.px-4.py-2.max-w-64.truncate title=outbox_subject(message)
                = outbox_subject(message) || content_tag(:span, "(no subject)", class: "text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500")
              td.px-4.py-2.whitespace-nowrap= outbox_attempts_label(message)
              td.px-4.py-2.max-w-72.truncate.text-xs.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400 title=message.last_error
                = message.last_error
              td.px-4.py-2.text-right
                = button_to "Delete", outbox_message_path(message), method: :delete,
                    class: "inline-block cursor-pointer rounded-md border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-red-700 dark:text-red-400",
                    form: { data: { turbo_confirm: "Delete the failed message to #{message.recipient}?" }, class: "inline-block" }
    = render "shared/pagination", page: @failed_page, pages: @failed_pages, count: @failed_count, noun: "failed deliveries", url: ->(page) { outbox_messages_path(page: page) }
  - else
    p.text-sm.text-slate-500.dark:text-slate-400 No failed deliveries.
